2025-12-01 13:57:20 +0900  Seungha Yang <seungha@centricular.com>

	  asiodeviceprovider: Fix deadlock on stop
	  Ensure that main loop is fully running during start() to avoid
	  below deadlock sequence
	  * GstDeviceProvider::start() spawns a background thread
	  * GstDeviceProvider::stop() is called before the background thread
	  actually starts running the main loop
	  * g_main_loop_quit() is invoked, but since the main loop has not
	  started yet, it has no effect
	  * stop() waits for the background thread to join
	  * The background thread eventually starts the main loop on the
	  background thread
	  Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer/-/merge_requests/10245>

