	* sys/va/gstvaencoder.h:
	  vaencoder: split open() in setup() and open_2()
	  Still keep open() for backward compatibility as a composite of both new
	  functions.
	  setup() -> creates VA config
	  open_2() -> creates VA context
	  The reason to use open_2() is because there's a close() and we should keep the
	  API symmetry.
